{"id":"n38128-1-9","stage":5,"title":"기력 · 力气","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38128-1-9-1","ko":"아버지 건강은 좀 어떠시니?","zh":"您父亲的身体健康状况怎么样呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아버지","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"2","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}},{"text":"건강은","meaning":"健康","explanation":"건강：健康；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"건강","audio":"/audio/b9e697a6a3627e47a5d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36670","senseId":"1","lemma":"건강","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건강은","audio":"/audio/b019c2c0fa86eb1196c3.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"어떠시니?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떠시니","audio":"/audio/faced9dba10a8bc31773.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"b9e697a6a3627e47","term":"건강","zh":"健康","audio":"/audio/b9e697a6a3627e47a5d1.mp3","entryId":"36670","definition":"指身体或精神没有异常、很结实的状态。","pronunciation":["건ː강"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/3c986e0ec36e9c3ea3a4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n38128-1-9-2","ko":"큰 병을 앓으신 뒤에 기력이 많이 쇠하셨어요.","zh":"自从患了重病之后，他的体力已经大大下降了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"큰","meaning":"重，重大，严重","explanation":"크다：重，重大，严重；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"3","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"큰","audio":"/audio/697674905873e8eb4c58.mp3"}},{"text":"병을","meaning":"病","explanation":"병：病；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"병","audio":"/audio/31eaf1068c99d7f1add7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62694","senseId":"2","lemma":"병","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"병을","audio":"/audio/72b58c8ef0644a3f4361.mp3"}},{"text":"앓으신","meaning":"患，得，病","explanation":"앓다：患，得，病；으시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"앓다","audio":"/audio/387f8dcdd779a212c4b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62325","senseId":"1","lemma":"앓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앓으신","audio":"/audio/27154846516dbd6980a5.mp3"}},{"text":"뒤에","meaning":"之后，下一个，接下来","explanation":"뒤：之后，下一个，接下来；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"뒤","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67477","senseId":"5","lemma":"뒤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒤에","audio":"/audio/0350898692fd4601facb.mp3"}},{"text":"기력이","meaning":"力气","explanation":"기력：力气；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기력","audio":"/audio/2f1887b3ecd677037d3e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38128","senseId":"1","lemma":"기력","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기력이","audio":"/audio/37cd563e594a4bc347f3.mp3"}},{"text":"많이",